    <system:String x:Key="ReverseControlPrerequisiteStatus">Confirme os pré-requisitos antes de continuar</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="ReverseControlPrerequisiteWiredTitle">Antes de habilitar o controle com cabo</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="ReverseControlPrerequisiteWiredBody">1. Turn on Developer Mode and restart the device.
2. Connect by USB, unlock it, and tap “Trust This Computer”.
3. The matching DDI downloads from GitHub on first use.
4. No input is sent until setup is ready.

Click Continue when ready, or Cancel.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="ReverseControlPrerequisiteWirelessTitle">Antes de habilitar o controle sem fio</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="ReverseControlPrerequisiteWirelessBody">1. Turn on Developer Mode and restart the device.
2. Complete trust and wireless pairing once over USB.
3. Keep the device unlocked on the same local network.
4. Allow iPhoneMirror through Windows Firewall.

Click Continue when ready, or Cancel.</system:String>
